    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>. Define <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>S</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>S</mi></math>&nbsp;as&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>n</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"\" open=\"{\"><mtable columnalign=\"center left\"><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>if</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>11</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>if</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>10</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math><br />Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>S</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mi>S</mi></math>&nbsp;be a function such that <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>fog</mi><mfenced><mi>n</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>if</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>is</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>odd</mi><mo>&#160;</mo></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>if</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>is&#160;</mtext><mi>even</mi><mo>&#160;</mo></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math>, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mn>10</mn></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi